WEBVTT

00:04:27.555 --> 00:04:31.100
So that means if I had been born
as a commercial building,

00:04:31.142 --> 00:04:33.019
I would have been killed 12 years ago.

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:34.687
(Laughter)

00:04:35.438 --> 00:04:36.981
It's quite straightforward.

00:04:37.982 --> 00:04:40.943
When people don't love --

00:04:40.985 --> 00:04:42.445
and I'm using the word love --

00:04:42.445 --> 00:04:43.904
love buildings,

00:04:43.904 --> 00:04:46.032
they're more likely to demolish them.

00:04:46.949 --> 00:04:49.744
I feel those two dots
haven't been connected together.

00:04:51.203 --> 00:04:52.955
But when you make a building,

00:04:52.955 --> 00:04:56.876
one of the most expensive things
you can possibly do,

00:04:56.876 --> 00:05:02.340
there are understandably huge
pressures of cost of time,